It's just a...

840
01:21:00.443 --> 01:21:03.612
It's not a goat. It's not a goat.
It's not a goat.

841
01:21:03.780 --> 01:21:06.323
It's not a goat. It's not a goat.

842
01:21:06.491 --> 01:21:11.412
It's not a goat.

