854
01:24:40.288 --> 01:24:43.248
Use the card. Quick.

855
01:24:43.416 --> 01:24:45.167
Reprogram.

856
01:25:03.687 --> 01:25:05.521
Alien life form.

857
01:25:08.191 --> 01:25:09.983
Must destroy.

858
01:25:38.388 --> 01:25:39.972
Alien life form.

859
01:25:40.140 --> 01:25:42.349
Must destroy.

860
